 wondering if you could do a full art Pokémon card of my Vtuber Rai and Luxray. Rai is a storm chaser, who is adventurous and really cool, he has some set of styles but I want his hair to be up please. As for poses and expressions I'll leave that to you! I would also like to share this on social platforms with credit. Thank you so much!!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nagKmVStDapWlQv1z7dcV92q_O8v69-C?usp=drive_link", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@SketchesTaiyo/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2156683, "client_id": 989650, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a4c00379/uploads/origins/2a8f855c-3b53-475c-a55b-8f76fe88c5f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c1a03e1c3582d10f3c97fce03459e94", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a4c00379/uploads/origins/2a8f855c-3b53-475c-a55b-8f76fe88c5f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c1a03e1c3582d10f3c97fce03459e94, https://si.imgix.net/a4c00379/uploads/origins/2a8f855c-3b53-475c-a55b-8f76fe88c5f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12e36b1fddfd2bfa385ab3ef33fa83fd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a4c00379/uploads/origins/2a8f855c-3b53-475c-a55b-8f76fe88c5f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d685e2296a1a3f13a116ca6b752a6469 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a4c00379/uploads/origins/2a8f855c-3b53-475c-a55b-8f76fe88c5f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=27acc8e63a96f1d3feb2b53f3893d2c1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a4c00379/uploads/origins/2a8f855c-3b53-475c-a55b-8f76fe88c5f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=27acc8e63a96f1d3feb2b53f3893d2c1, https://si.imgix.net/a4c00379/uploads/origins/2a8f855c-3b53-475c-a55b-8f76fe88c5f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=40365ab2467e2efe7fca14d097f32622 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a4c00379/uploads/origins/2a8f855c-3b53-475c-a55b-8f76fe88c5f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cfe41497dbe50f63075fea6e217c0b42 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you! I would like to request illustrations of Aiori, an original character in the Pokemon world, and my cat Ranya (Persian male in different color Alola).\nReference image: This is the folder -> https://sta.sh/2y0tsvh6n7z\n\nCharacter details (as shown in the image \"aiori ref sheet\")\nAiori: Elegant and princess-like.\nAiori: She is elegant and has a princess-like aura. She likes fashion (Japanese clothes, Lolita clothes). Her personality is calm and collected, but in fact she is a bit childish and a bit tsundere.\nShe is very short (~145cm), but is actually an adult (~30s).\nShe has round eyebrows.\nMakeup (lipstick and eye shadow, both in red)\nHer hair length is ~ to her thighs and knees. Her hair is long, from her thighs to her knees, and her bangs are swirl shaped like \"aiori hair\" (similar to a Persian tail).\nWhite eyepatch on right eye, red on left eye\n\n→And Ran'ya (Persian) wears a pearl collar. Compared to Aiori, Ranya's size is like a tiger (she is a bit bigger than the other Persians)\n\n▪ Expression, pose, and background\nAiori's expression is calm and almost expressionless. Ranya is left up to you (a little grin or something would be nice).\nAiori is sitting with Ranya in the pose and background as shown in the images \"pose\" and \"background\".\nThe background is a Taisho-romantic interior, and Aiori and Ranya are sitting on a red sofa like in the image \"background\". It would be nice to have a similar stained glass window in the back.\nI'd like to have camellia flowers (red) scattered here and there to create a winter image.\n\nClothing: High-color, Taisho-roman style clothing.\nRed kimono (preferably with a thin arrow-feather pattern).\nUnderneath the kimono is a high collar blouse with lace around the neck and a brooch (either a mega keystone or a single color is acceptable).\nOff-white hakama (gold embroidery does not need to be so detailed).\nHakama with tassel-like golden monster ball-like ornaments (same as Ranya's collar).\nBlack fur shawl on the shoulder (red gradient or all black is fine)\nEarrings (pearls)\nHer charm point is a big red ribbon in her hair accessory.\nGold wedding ring on her left hand\n\nhttps://sta.sh/2y0tsvh6n7z", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@SketchesTaiyo/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2156683, "client_id": 2012908, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/73b90909/uploads/origins/9574c727-2de6-4f04-834b-0c978b88f9eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7d1efaaa7cf76c69672cc439577cc92", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/73b90909/uploads/origins/9574c727-2de6-4f04-834b-0c978b88f9eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7d1efaaa7cf76c69672cc439577cc92, https://si.imgix.net/73b90909/uploads/origins/9574c727-2de6-4f04-834b-0c978b88f9eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8a6fc1d620126ffafe8bb9ff858c367 2x, https://si.imgix.net/73b90909/uploads/origins/9574c727-2de6-4f04-834b-0c978b88f9eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ba66b3126854864387c6226f91d72a84 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/73b90909/uploads/origins/9574c727-2de6-4f04-834b-0c978b88f9eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=we